              span.date 2026 - present
            div.experience-content
              div.role
                h4 Head of Product Design, Billing and Commerce Systems

          div.experience-item
            div.experience-header
              h2.alt-heading.company-name Flatiron Health
              span.date 2019 - 2026
            div.experience-content
              div.role
                h4 Head of Design
                p I led a team of 20+ Designers that span across Product Design, Brand, and Design Infrastructure. Together we helped drive product strategy, scaled design's impact through systems and practices, and elevated oncology research takeaways through visual storytelling. Our work powered technology that helped us learn from every person's experience with cancer.
              div.role
                h4 Senior Director, Product Design
                p As a Senior Director, I led our Healthcare Design team and Design Systems team. Our Flagship product is an EHR built for Oncologists, used to document patient care and order treatment.
                p Our Design Systems initiative spans all products across the business, including internal tooling that helps us enable cancer research and insights powered by real world data.
                p.previous-role Previously — Director of Product Design, Healthcare & Lead Product Design Manager

          div.experience-item
            div.experience-header
              h2.alt-heading.company-name Design Mentor
              span.date 2015 - present
            div.experience-content
              div.role
                h4 Various
                p I mentor designers looking to make the transition into product design and design management. I've worked with organizations like Bloc and General Assembly to pair directly with individuals as well as teach courses focused on getting started with front-end development. Currently, I'm mentoring master's students at the University of Washington's HCDE program.

          div.experience-item
            div.experience-header
              h2.alt-heading.company-name ATTN: Media
              span.date 2014 - 2018
            div.experience-content
              div.role
                h4 Product Design Manager
                p As a Manager, I led a team focused on building web-based engagement platforms that paired with our scripted media. My team also designed and prototyped internal tools that helped streamline content discoverability and content management across thousands of files and social posts.
                p.previous-role Previously — UI Engineer

